'''Nova''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 3]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
Its blade is maroon red in color, which fades into a darker shade by the heel. The guard is also maroon red, and the handle is solid black. The unreleased version appears visually identical in the exception that its blade and guard are dull yellow in color instead of maroon.

==Trivia==
*Nova’s unreleased version was published to the Roblox Library by [[Nikilis]] on April 22, 2021.<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/6711924013/Nova The model of the unreleased version]</ref>

